        "description": "Runs the governed model slice. Defaults to the mock; optional server-configured LiteLLM execution buffers text for response inspection. External execution receipts survive restarts; an interrupted receipt returns OUTCOME_UNKNOWN. No caller-provided provider URL or credential is accepted."
      }
